   ],
   "spoken": "The Vienna Gambit — the knight to c3, then f4, offering the f-pawn. We're sacrificing for two things: a bigger center with d4, and the open f-file, which will hand our rook a battering-ram file against f7 once we castle.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
