   "line": [
    "O-O"
   ],
   "spoken": "Don't go pawn-hunting: grabbing on c6 and e5 doesn't even win a pawn — it runs into a queen check on d4 forking king and knight. The Vienna is about development and attack, not the material.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
